	(text "NTC1-3 = heatsink sections a-c: lug probe on the EARTHED heatsink, >= 2.5 kV rms lead-to-lug (R-10).\nNTC5-7 = L1 winding NTCs (leads on 2-pin headers). 100 nF at each header."
